      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "# LIVING AZEROTH  //  PRIVATE OPERATIONS\nBackend-only telemetry for the controller-owned WoW runtime. Planned development-offline mode is an explicit healthy operating state when the security boundary passes. Metrics contain aggregate counts only; no credentials, player identities, prompts, or chat responses are exported. Player traffic must remain Tailscale-only and Funnel must remain off.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
